Short: 8 doors for Zeus BBS, includes source.
Uploader: rodsch@telusplanet.net (Rod Schnell)
Author:   rodsch@telusplanet.net (Rod Schnell)
Type:     comm/bbs

A collection of 7 online doors and 1 CLI utility for Zeus BBS.

Online doors: CallerStats, LastCalls, TimeStats, UserList, Who, WhoIs
              and ZMenuBar.
CLI programs: Lighting file lister.

Full source is included for all programs in this collection. All of these
programs are hereby released into the public domain.
